// A warranty deed of Lot 7 from Robert Hale to Sofia Marin (deed.md).
Document "deed.md".

Fact person Identified by Robert, Sofia
Placeholder grantor For person
Placeholder grantee For person
Fact parcel Identified by Lot7
Function title Identified by parcel * person
Input Fact lien Identified by parcel * string

// D.1 to D.3, D.5: signing, delivery, and what a delivery can pass
Fact deed Identified by grantor * grantee * parcel
Fact recorded Identified by grantee * parcel
Input Fact paid-value Identified by grantee * parcel
Input Fact notice Identified by grantee * parcel

Act sign Actor grantor Recipient grantee Related to parcel
  Holds when True

Power deliver Actor grantor Recipient grantee Related to parcel
  Holds when Done(sign(grantor, grantee, parcel))
  Valid when Done(sign(grantor, grantee, parcel))
    && (title(parcel, grantor)
        || (paid-value(grantee, parcel) && !notice(grantee, parcel)
            && (Exists grantee': deed(grantor, grantee', parcel) && title(parcel, grantee')
                  && !recorded(grantee', parcel))))
  Creates title(parcel, grantee), deed(grantor, grantee, parcel)
        , (Foreach lien: warranted(grantor, grantee, parcel, lien.string) When lien.parcel == parcel)

Act record Actor grantee Related to parcel
  Holds when (Exists grantor: deed(grantor, grantee, parcel))
  Creates recorded(grantee, parcel)

// D.4 Warranty against liens
Fact warranted Identified by grantor * grantee * parcel * string
Duty payoff-due Holder grantor Claimant grantee Related to parcel, string
  Due within 30 days
  Created by demand-payoff
  Terminated by pay-off
Act demand-payoff Actor grantee Recipient grantor Related to parcel, string
  Holds when warranted(grantor, grantee, parcel, string) && lien(parcel, string)
Act pay-off Actor grantor Recipient grantee Related to parcel, string
  Holds when lien(parcel, string)
  Terminates lien(parcel, string)

Clause D.1 => sign, deliver, title(Lot7, Robert)
Clause D.2 => sign, deliver
Clause D.3 => deliver
Clause D.4/1 Definition => warranted
Clause D.4/2 => demand-payoff, payoff-due, pay-off
Clause D.5 => deliver, record, paid-value, notice.
